    "created_at": "2026-06-18T18:29:57Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-06-18T18:29:57Z",
    "body": "Chromium shipped [Automatic Fullscreen Content Setting](https://chromestatus.com/feature/6218822004768768) for isolated context web apps (and enterprise policy).\n\nThere's also the [Capability Delegation](https://wicg.github.io/capability-delegation/spec.html#monkey-patch-to-fullscreen) of fullscreen, but there's no obvious way to transmit this across reload/nav.\n\nThere are tough usable security issues with drive-by sites entering fullscreen without a user activation; perhaps the same is still true of non-isolated context installed web apps.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
