    "created_at": "2026-06-18T20:15:04Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-06-18T20:32:13Z",
    "body": "Thanks for linking to the chromium's feature, <s>it looks like it help for now</s> (no, unfortunately it's only for IWAs)\n\n> There are tough usable security issues with drive-by sites entering fullscreen without a user activation;\n\nI think it won't be a problem if we allow fullscreen on load only if the previous document before unload was in fullscreen. It won't look like the website entered fullscreen without a gesture. It will look like it quickly re-entered for a reload\n",
